  <History Date="18-10-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="17-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from ACME XP-3500 Wash" />
  <History Date="19-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="24-07-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added fixed colour names and swatches to modes 1 and 3 in response to manufacturer request.  Mode 2 colours are a mystery." />
  <History Date="01-08-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised mode 2 fixed colours with names+swatches and added 'white' range (seems strange)" />
  <History Date="15-08-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Inverted P/T and CMY Speed in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="19-08-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM IDs (note personality IDs not currently available - modes 2 and 3 have the same channel footprint)" />
